  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="32.5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 32.5</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="32.5" corresp="#wit-d">Ac þæt unriht alegde ure hlaford; þæt he ma mote.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="32.5" corresp="#wit-d">Ac þæt unriht alegde ure hlaford; þæt he ma mote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">But this practice has been stopped by our lord. May he succeed in stopping more!</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-g">But our lord has suppressed that abuse. May he do more.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Aber dieses Unrecht beseitigte unser Herr; dass er nur mehr [beseitigen] könne!</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">But our lord has put an end to this injustice; may he be able [to put an end to] more!</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Only in D.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
